Convert text into unique and stunning artworks in just seconds with A.I Art Generator App. Unleash your creativity with the power of artificial intelligence and deep learning algorithms.

App includes a wide range of art styles to choose from, such as: 3D Render, Surreal, Anime, Portrait, Cinematic, Cyberpunk, Steampunk, Futuristic and more. Simply enter your prompt or choose any from prompt ideas and select an art style, then watch as the AI generates a unique and captivating image that will impress. But that's not all - app is designed to be user-friendly and easy to use, with a sleek and modern interface that makes generating art easily and fast.

Whether you're an artist, designer, or just looking to create something beautiful, our A.I Art Generator App is the perfect tool for unleashing your creativity and exploring the limitless possibilities of art. Don’t wait! Try the app and experience the power of AI art generation process by yourself.

 APP CONTENT & MAIN FEATURES: 
• AI ART GENERATOR • 
Unleash your creativity to generate unique piece of art. Enter the prompt, then select an art style, and AI will draw artwork in just seconds. Also, you can retry generation if you are not satisfied with the result, save art on your device, print or share it and do whatever you want. Note: The more details you provide, the better the results will be. 
• AI ART GALLERY •
 Includes 19 art categories (1 art per category for free) and ready prompts to try on your own. Also, you can save them on your device and do whatever you want.
 • 30+ ART STYLES •
 Such as: 3D Render, Surreal, Anime, Portrait, Cinematic, Cyberpunk, Steampunk, Futuristic and more.

Note that the free version of the app is limited to:
– 1 AI Art Generation;
– 10 Art Styles;
– 19 Arts from AI Art Gallery and Prompts for them for Free;
If you want to use the app without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”A.I Art Generator Pro” is available.
 
Auto-renewable Subscription ”A.I Art Generator Pro” Info:
By subscribing you get premium (full, unlimited) access to all the features and content offered by A.I Art Generator App.

Auto-renewable Subscription “A.I Art Generator Pro” Includes:
– Generate Arts Unlimited;
– Unlock All Art Styles;
– Unlock All Gallery Arts & Regular New;
– Try & Retry Gallery Prompts Unlimited;
– Highest Resolution of Generated Arts;

The app contains the following auto-renewable subscription called ”A.I Art Generator Pro”:
– Weekly (4,99 US$ / Week).
* Subscription price may vary depending on your location;
* Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;
* Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;
* Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;
* Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account;
* Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.

